OL,3,GNEWSAFormer PC admits sexual
OL,4,Acommunication with child
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former police officer has pleaded
OL,7,Fguilty to sexual communication with a
OL,8,F14-year-old girl he met while on duty.
OL,10,FMatthew Hunt, 27, who worked for
OL,11,FNorthamptonshire Police in Response
OL,12,FPolicing was sacked from the force in
OL,13,FDecember 2024.
OL,15,FAt Leicester Crown Court on Friday,
OL,16,FHunt, from Earl Shilton, near Hinckley,
OL,17,Fadmitted to the offence. He had
OL,18,Fpreviously admitted one count of
OL,19,Fmisconduct in a public office.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
